{
  "$comment": "审计报告的机器可读契约。此前该契约只存在于 check_audit_gate.py 的正则里——改规则的人无从得知自己在破坏一个解析器。真源定义见 rules/治理指令.md「审计」节第 5 条。",
  "title": "audit_report",
  "target": "05_审计报告.md / Audit_<ID>_主题方案审计.md",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["front_matter", "issue_format"],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "front_matter": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["type", "topic", "date", "author", "status", "independence"],
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "properties": {
        "type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["Audit"] },
        "topic": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "date": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$" },
        "author": { "type": "string", "enum": ["Reviewer"] },
        "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["active", "completed"] },
        "independence": {
          "$comment": "必填且不得留空。缺失时 check_audit_gate.py 视为违规阻断（fail-closed）——此前缺失即放行，忘写字段就能绕过 Critical 关闭限制。",
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^(external:\\s*\\S.*|session-internal-downgraded \\(external: .+ (missing|failed)\\))$"
        }
      }
    },
    "issue_format": {
      "$comment": "正文每条问题的行内标注格式，供 check_audit_gate.py 机械识别。中英文冒号均可。",
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["level_field", "status_field"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "level_field": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["pattern", "enum"],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "pattern": { "type": "string", "enum": ["级别[:：]\\s*(Critical|Major|Minor)"] },
            "enum": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": { "type": "string", "enum": ["Critical", "Major", "Minor"] }
            }
          }
        },
        "status_field": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["pattern", "enum"],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "pattern": { "type": "string", "enum": ["状态[:：]\\s*(待处理|已关闭)"] },
            "enum": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": { "type": "string", "enum": ["待处理", "已关闭"] }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "instance": {
    "$comment": "本 schema 描述的规范实例，同时作为 validate_schema.py 的自检样例。",
    "front_matter": {
      "type": "Audit",
      "topic": "某系统设计方案",
      "date": "2026-09-05",
      "author": "Reviewer",
      "status": "active",
      "independence": "external: some-reviewer-cli"
    },
    "issue_format": {
      "level_field": {
        "pattern": "级别[:：]\\s*(Critical|Major|Minor)",
        "enum": ["Critical", "Major", "Minor"]
      },
      "status_field": {
        "pattern": "状态[:：]\\s*(待处理|已关闭)",
        "enum": ["待处理", "已关闭"]
      }
    }
  }
}
